			"notes": "- Updated to minecraft 26.1\n- Updated for minebox V2 S1\n- Added an option to resize HUD widgets and icons orientation\n- Now HUD widgets stay inside screen bounds on resize/fullscreen changes\n- Added a search bar for insects menu\n- Item Highlight: Golden border on inventory slots whose item score exceeds a configurable threshold\n- Integrated minebox api for commands:\n   - /mbtlookup {pseudo} to inspect a player profile (name / playtime / first seen / last seen / instance / guild / jobs level / skulls / museum collection / number of quest completed)\n   - /mbtlevel {pseudo} {jobs} {level} to retrieve the exp amount necessary for the player to reach the wanted level\n   - /mbtguild {guild_name} to retrieve information about a guild\n- Added the location of new crops found in expedition in the item tooltip\n- Fixed item durability blinking on usage"
		},
